{{Navbar-Global Gas Infrastructure Tracker}}

'''Double E Pipeline Project''' is an operating gas pipeline in the USA. It was initially proposed as an oil pipeline but cancelled in 2011.<ref name=source1>[http://bit.ly/2pnnW2H Double E Pipeline Project,] A Barrel Full, accessed Sep. 2017.</ref> However, in 2018 the project was re-proposed, with new owners and a reduced length and capacity, to carry gas instead of oil.<ref name=source2>[http://www.doubleepipeline.com/ Double E Pipeline] Double E Pipeline, accessed Jul. 13, 2020.</ref>

