*'''Cost:''' $450 million<ref name=":1" />
*'''Financing: ''' US$80 million equity investment from global alternative asset firm TPG Capital;<ref name="Kall">[https://www.kallanishenergy.com/2019/12/31/summit-midstream-inks-deal-to-finance-double-e-pipeline/ "Summit Midstream inks deal to finance Double E Pipeline",] Kallanish Energy, Dec. 31, 2019</ref><ref name=":0" /> US$175 million in loans from three undisclosed commercial banks <ref name="pgj"> [https://pgjonline.com/news/2021/february/summit-midstream-announces-175-million-commitments-for-double-e-pipeline-project "Summit Midstream Announces $175 million Commitments for Double E Pipeline Project"], Pipeline & Gas Journal, Feb. 2, 2021</ref><ref name=":0" />

